{"articleNo":"48292","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=48292&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"구미시 청년CEO육성사업 공고","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2012.04.21","hit":"4246","attachments":[{"name":"201220구미시 청년CEO 육성사업(제3기)모집공고.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=48292&attachNo=70327"},{"name":"2012 구미시 청년CEO 육성사업(제3기) 참가지원신청서.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=48292&attachNo=70418"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>&nbsp;</p><table style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" align=\"center\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 2pt double; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 2pt double; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 2pt double; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 2pt double; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" bgcolor=\"#e5e5e5\" height=\"84\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"465\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼옛체'; COLOR: #5d8931; FONT-SIZE: 20pt\">『2012. 구미시 청년CEO 육성사업』</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼옛체'; FONT-SIZE: 20pt\">제3기 구미시 청년창업자 모집공고</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\">&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt; FONT-FAMILY: 'HY신명조'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\">「2012. 구미시 청년CEO 육성사업」과 관련하여 구미시에서는 우수하고 참신한 아이템으로 </span></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">창업에 도전을 희망하는 청년창업자를 모집하고자 하오니 젊고 패기 있는 예비청년창업 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">자의 많은 참여 바랍니다.</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: right; MARGIN-TOP: 5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -10pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 'HY신명조'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><br></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 'HY신명조'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\">2012. 04.0 9</span></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: right; MARGIN-TOP: 5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -10pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 'HY신명조'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\">(재)구미전자정보기술원장</span></span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -10pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">1.신청대상</span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\">-&nbsp;연 령 : 접수마감일 기준 만15세 이상 ~ 만39세 이하</span></span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -10pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\">-&nbsp;거주지 : 접수마감일 기준 구미시 주소(주민등록등본 기준) 또는 본적을 둔자</span></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN-TOP: 3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -10pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 'HY중고딕'\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN-TOP: 3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -10pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 'HY중고딕'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font color=\"#ff007f\">(*접수마감일: 2012. 5. 18.)</font></span></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN-TOP: 3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -10pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN-TOP: 3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -10pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: 'HY신명조'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">-&nbsp;분야 및 업종</span></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN-TOP: 3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -10pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><table style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" bgcolor=\"#e5e5e5\" height=\"32\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"101\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 'HY중고딕'\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\">분 야</span></span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" bgcolor=\"#e5e5e5\" height=\"32\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"496\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 'HY중고딕'\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\">업&nbsp;&nbsp; 종</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"41\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"101\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 'HY중고딕'\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\">기술창업&nbsp;</span></span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"41\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"496\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 'HY중고딕'\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\">&nbsp;기계, 재료, 전기？전자, 정보통신, 화공, 섬유, 생명, 식품, 환경,</span></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 'HY중고딕'\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\">&nbsp;신재생에너지, 공예 등</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"46\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"101\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 'HY중고딕'\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\">지식창업</span></span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"46\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"496\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 'HY중고딕'\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\">&nbsp;지식콘텐츠, 마케팅홍보, 전문컨설팅, 디자인,번역, 웹디자인,&nbsp; 프리랜스,</span></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 'HY중고딕'\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\">&nbsp;통신업, 문화서비스업, 통신판매업, 인터넷 쇼핑몰, 아이디어 창업 등 </span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"34\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"101\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 'HY중고딕'\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\">일반창업</span></span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"34\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"496\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; MARGIN-LEFT: 6pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; FONT-FAMILY: 'HY중고딕'\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\">부가가치가 높은 소상공인창업, 지역본사프랜차이즈 창업 등</span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -10pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 'HY신명조'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\">- <span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">우수한 창업아이템을 보유하고 창업 의지가 강한 예비창업자</span></span></span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -10pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 'HY신명조'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">- 창의적 아이디어, 기술, 전문지식을 가진 자로 창업을 하고자 하는 예비창업자</span></span></span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -10pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 'HY신명조'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">- SOHO(가정 또는 소규모 사무실에서 전문지식, 경험, 아이디어 등을 발전시켜 네트워크나 정보통신기술 등을 활용한 사업 창업 희망자</span></span></span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -10pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 'HY신명조'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">- 접수마감일 기준 사업자등록일 </span></span></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">1년 미만</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">인 청년창업자 지원가능</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -10pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">- 세부사항은 첨부파일 참조</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -10pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 'HY신명조'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">-----------------------------------------</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -10pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 'HY신명조'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\">기타 문의사항 및 접수처</span></span></span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -10pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><!--StartFragment--><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 'HY신명조'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\">- 진흥센터(이오스관 313호) </span></span></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 'HY신명조'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\">창업전담관 송윤주 </span></span></span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -10pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 'HY신명조'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\">- 054)&nbsp;478-6944,</span></span></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 'HY신명조'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><a style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\" href=\"mailto:wndbs75@kumoh.ac.kr\">wndbs75@kumoh.ac.kr</a></span></span></span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -10pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 'HY신명조'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\">-<font color=\"#0900ff\"> 금오공대 재학생은 5월 18일까지 이메일 접수</font></span></span></span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 3